{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-113","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：可公度量与截差无理线段与二项无理线段","englishTitle":"The square on a rational straight line, if applied to an apotome, produces as, breadth the binomial straight line the terms of which are commensurable with the terms of the apotome and in the same ratio; and further the binomial so arising has the same order as the apotome.","book":10,"number":113,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.113","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_3.113/","group":"prop_3","sourceNumber":113,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","contentId":"euclid-10-113","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3d64939b797ca872e077e66df1c0426835d5e7144603867a1d27e07ff72f4801","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-113.statement","euclid-10-113.construction.1","euclid-10-113.construction.2","euclid-10-113.construction.3","euclid-10-113.proof.1","euclid-10-113.proof.2","euclid-10-113.proof.3","euclid-10-113.proof.4","euclid-10-113.construction.4","euclid-10-113.proof.5","euclid-10-113.construction.5","euclid-10-113.proof.6","euclid-10-113.proof.7","euclid-10-113.proof.8","euclid-10-113.proof.9","euclid-10-113.proof.10","euclid-10-113.proof.11","euclid-10-113.proof.12","euclid-10-113.proof.13","euclid-10-113.proof.14","euclid-10-113.proof.15","euclid-10-113.proof.16","euclid-10-113.conclusion","euclid-10-113.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-113.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c43df0bedecc3a1e8bbc914507fe35efde61d9e3c1dbbd64248fdba2139554c3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The square on a rational straight line, if applied to an apotome, produces as, breadth the binomial straight line the terms of which are commensurable with the terms of the apotome and in the same ratio; and further the binomial so arising has the same order as the apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"有理线段上的正方形,如果适用于截差无理线段,则产生二项无理线段直线宽度,其条件为截差无理线段,比例相同;此外,由此产生的二项无理线段的顺序与截差无理线段的顺序相同；上述对应量可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6b2ec1892ff5a26cbc2bfa1b4595619ce7e58e186d7cb9e52f1ba9c85dc23d6e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A be a rational straight line and BD an apotome, and let the rectangle BD, KH be equal to the square on A, so that the square on the rational straight line A when applied to the apotome BD produces KH as breadth; I say that KH is a binomial straight line the terms of which are commensurable with the terms of BD and in the same ratio; and further KH has the same order as BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A是有理线段,BD是截差无理线段,截差无理线段,矩形,KH等于A,有理线段,有理线段、A,正方形是截差无理线段,BD,截差无理线段是宽度;我说,KH是二项无理线段直线,条件为可公度,条件为BD,比例相同;还有KH的顺序与BD相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf83daa36eb5e604ed51a8909d6eb5a1816fa66e42b04634edaa68137495a8a2","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let DC be the annex to BD; therefore BC, CD are rational straight lines commensurable in square only. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DC是BD的附件;因此,BC,CD是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"56f0f6b6865e0c3196a63535d9f2c2b0903583f775be944750979fa1dcddc276","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the rectangle BC, G be also equal to the square on A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC,G 也等于A的正方形"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d9a3fa22c6a8e719f25b1b775b114049ffa4e4b3c51fab05b611fbf092fbeb3c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on A is rational; therefore the rectangle BC, G is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A正方形是有理,矩形BCG也是有理"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"115fecced25768aa7e9c03dda2b967741307dac23354e95b0555e2287b525b5d","citations":["euclid-10-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it has been applied to the rational straight line BC; therefore G is rational and commensurable in length with BC. [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"适用于有理线段 BC;因此,G为有理和长度可公度为BC。 [[X. 20](/principles/euclid-10-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88550b1035e3e5efd08cf095d5287fa7e4e7c6e002446b70fb4545898207d395","citations":["euclid-6-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since now the rectangle BC, G is equal to the rectangle BD, KH, therefore, proportionally, as CB is to BD, so is KH to G. [[VI. 16](/principles/euclid-6-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从现在起,矩形 BC G等于矩形 BD,KH,因此,按比例计算,CB-BD的比例等于KH-G的比例；CB 与 BD 之比等于 KH 与 G 之比。 [[VI. 16](/principles/euclid-6-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f2b0b57aa5e5e64607447e2f818ecd26408fc06c7623393e94edf0a809507a7f","citations":["euclid-5-16","euclid-5-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BC is greater than BD; therefore KH is also greater than G. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16), [V. 14](/principles/euclid-5-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BC大于BD;因此,KH件也大于G件。[ 音 ] [ [V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16) [V. 14](/principles/euclid-5-14)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":8,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"50b5080fe687f32f31c7934b77c2ee20233578bceea1a5ab091ab4600d4f7dec","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let KE be made equal to G; therefore KE is commensurable in length with BC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"KE等于G,因此KE等于长度可公度等于BC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"402daf512f32124ec8a8e8f3cade17d00b45b49ded3760b3da7278a1cdb066b9","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as CB is to BD, so is HK to KE, therefore, convertendo, as BC is to CD, so is KH to HE. [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CB对BD的比等于HK对KE的比,因此,转换后,BC对CD的比等于KH对HE的比；CB 与 BD 之比等于 HK 与 KE 之比；BC 与 CD 之比等于 KH 与 HE 之比。 [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.construction.5","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":10,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9507e9d8ce695d18ede479e179707365556a2d46d491202a5e2ecb45d243e9ce","citations":["euclid-5-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be contrived that, as KH is to HE, so is HF to FE; therefore also the remainder KF is to FH as KH is to HE, that is, as BC is to CD. [[V. 19](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设KH对HE的比等于HF对FE的比;因此,其余KF对FH的比是KH对HE,即BC对CD；KH 与 HE 之比等于 HF 与 FE 之比；KF 与 FH 之比等于 KH 与 HE 之比。 [[V. 19](/principles/euclid-5-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fd17fc160155d90b52f3bbedd68a5e7f62fb1929c2cab0a6419ad578bf8216f9","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BC, CD are commensurable in square only; therefore KF, FH are also commensurable in square only. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BC,CD是平方可公度而长度不可公度,因此KF,FH也是平方可公度而长度不可公度。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae8a8448c525258027a4e9ed938495499523f3a2777ab6da6aef2775d8be0332","citations":["euclid-5-11","euclid-5-def-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, as KH is to HE, so is KF to FH, while, as KH is to HE, so is HF to FE, therefore also, as KF is to FH, so is HF to FE, [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] so that also, as the first is to the third, so is the square on the first to the square on the second; [[V. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-5-def-9)] therefore also, as KF is to FE, so is the square on KF to the square on FH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,KH对HE的比等于KF对FH的比,KH对HE的比等于HF对FE的比,KF对FH的比等于HF对FE的比,因此,第一对三的比等于第一个对正方形的比,第二个对正方形的比;因此,KF对FE的比等于KF对正方形的比；KH 与 HE 之比等于 KF 与 FH 之比；KH 与 HE 之比等于 HF 与 FE 之比；KF 与 FH 之比等于 HF 与 FE 之比 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] [[V. Def. 9](/principles/euclid-5-def-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9acb82aa20bc83df13b6f1c13776ab6bdb38eddb36aa9205312d27a0bc36daf7","citations":["euclid-10-11","euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on KF is commensurable with the square on FH, for KF, FH are commensurable in square; therefore KF is also commensurable in length with FE, [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)] so that KF is also commensurable in length with KE. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但KF的正方形和FH是可公度,KF和FH是可公度;因此,KF和FE也是长度可公度,KF和KE。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)] [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b6a60b2615bfae9f847e98fee4b6abf23981caf4758c6659220871a55c5b1861","citations":["euclid-10-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But KE is rational and commensurable in length with BC; therefore KF is also rational and commensurable in length with BC. [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但KE是有理,长度可公度是BC;因此,KF也是有理,长度可公度是BC。 [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be3972b68a83d6a2f34cbe9f5309a23b3514c2224702e6eea06d72241c68b3f3","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since, as BC is to CD, so is KF to FH, alternately, as BC is to KF, so is DC to FH. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BC对CD的比等于KF对FH的比,而BC对KF的比则等于DC对FH的比；BC 与 CD 之比等于 KF 与 FH 之比；BC 与 KF 之比等于 DC 与 FH 之比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"360d00ca8d0e01088b6d58e8b250eff9f64affda930f7c6b8fa517d1ca460dca","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BC is commensurable with KF; therefore FH is also commensurable in length with CD. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BC是可公度,KF;因此,FH也是长度可公度,CD。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3e26a293eee8dcb1d468df9c7c873c2dcb538dd763507186d383c5cc5ba0b0e5","citations":["euclid-10-def-3","euclid-10-36"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BC, CD are rational straight lines commensurable in square only; therefore KF, FH are also rational straight lines [[X. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-3)] commensurable in square only; therefore KH is binomial. [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BC,CD是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;因此,KF,FH也是有理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度;KH是二项无理线段。 [[X. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-10-def-3)] [[X. 36](/principles/euclid-10-36)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b9855c1034f28b7728ee13eb42c9a562f923f326e2a4325293e9c49e03078d2d","citations":["euclid-10-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If now the square on BC is greater than the square on CD by the square on a straight line commensurable with BC, the square on KF will also be greater than the square on FH by the square on a straight line commensurable with KF. [[X 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果现在BC线上的正方形比CD线上的正方形长,可公度上可公度上BC线上正方形上正方形上BC线上正方形上KF线上正方形上正方形上KF线上正方形上正方形上KF线上可公度上正方形上KF线上正方形上正方形上正方形上可公度上KF线上正方形上正方形上正方形上KF线上正方形上正方形上正方形上正方形上正方形上可公度上正方形上（相关点与线段：FH） [[X 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe5f6467f3ad21b5fa9dcff9c2c06e457e89cda29e3da3f1aa7f484d3a97a573","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if BC is commensurable in length with the rational straight line set out, so also is KF; if CD is commensurable in length with the rational straight line set out, so also is FH, but, if neither of the straight lines BC, CD, then neither of the straight lines KF, FH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果BC是有理线段,KF,有理线段也是KF,CD是有理线段,FH也是FH,但是,如果不是BC,CD,那么,KF,FH的直线都不是；上述对应量可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0192c4bdefdb78a76b19962c0fb3bbdca287e96080a4159a22f5984225f86037","citations":["euclid-10-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if the square on BC is greater than the square on CD by the square on a straight line incommensurable with BC, the square on KF is also greater than the square on FH by the square on a straight line incommensurable with KF. [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果BC的正方形比CD的正方形高,不可公度比BC线比正方形比BC线比正方形,KF线比FH线比正方形比不可公度比KF线比正方形比正方形比不可公度比KF线比正方形比正方形还大。 [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"413e38999d5eea18562b727b9e7e50dfa388203030292cfaa94d15a3408ab774","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if BC is commensurable with the rational straight line set out, so also is KF; if CD is so commensurable, in length with the rational straight line set out, so also is FH; but, if neither of the straight lines BC, CD, then neither of the straight lines KF, FH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果BC是有理线段,KF,那么KF,如果CD是可公度,那么有理线段,那么FH,那么,如果不是BC,CD,那么,如果不是CD,那么,KF,FH。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-113","revisionId":"euclid-10-113@raw-3d64939b797ca872","order":22,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e524d2f15338e80e46c28d692557c23c2b5899791595f9b051587a7c21ac4eaa","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore KH is a binomial straight line, the terms of which KF, FH are commensurable with the terms BC, CD of the apotome and in the same ratio, and further KH has the same order as BD. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,KH是二项无理线段直线,其中KF为KF,FH为可公度,截差无理线段为BC,CD为同一比例,还有KH为BD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-113.source","